# All three agent images build from the repo root (DockerImageAsset
# `directory: repoRoot`), so anything not excluded here feeds the context hash.
# None of the Dockerfiles COPY the paths below, but leaving them in meant a
# docs edit rehashed every image and forced a redeploy of both AgentCore
# runtimes plus the LiveKit worker.
docs/
